eplac parser turn out to be agpl licens\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"id\": \"944c8567f386bf1b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3914501768970267, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2282126669957525, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7723377, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1155, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:35\", \"token_count\": 555, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnable distributed zero-trust node synchronization for multi-site local deployments, requiring an authenticated handshake between nodes. Validation of the handshake under high-latency networks failed with timeouts; the fix depends on the completed encryption work, but the task remains blocked pending resolution.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\